Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.94,0:00:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,As we all travel across the sea,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.40,0:00:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,raising our voices, we take\Nin the beautiful blue world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.84,0:00:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Our spirits ready to\Ngo, everybody rejoices.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.32,0:00:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's go, get the sails all unfurled.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.52,0:00:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,La la la la la.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.16,0:00:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.08,0:00:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we are in between\Nthe sea and the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.64,0:00:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready now for adventure,\Nwe're itching to try.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.90,0:00:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Get ready to roam.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.54,0:00:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,So all aboard now!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.26,0:00:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We're set to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.98,0:00:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Set sail to the ocean so deep!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.06,0:00:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready for a truly grand adventure!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.30,0:00:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.12,0:00:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That sounds really fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.82,0:00:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,All this excitement!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.68,0:00:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Second to none!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.20,0:00:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,As we all travel across the sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.96,0:00:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Raising our voices!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.30,0:00:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We take in the beautiful blue world!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.30,0:00:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Our spirits ready to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.18,0:00:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody rejoices!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.92,0:01:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's go get the sales all unfurled!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.96,0:01:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,If there's something that\NI just won't ever forget!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.72,0:01:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the way that I felt\Nwhen our journey was set!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.28,0:01:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I won't be scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.86,0:01:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as I keep that feeling there!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.24,0:01:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,With that, let us keep up the pace!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.46,0:01:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,While enjoying every\Ntrip from place to place!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.04,0:01:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Our timid hearts get the rhythm and great!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.12,0:01:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's keep going, adventure awaits!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.58,0:01:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,So many treasures await!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.88,0:01:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,So now let's raise our voices in pride!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.40,0:01:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Laughing out when they are found!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.72,0:01:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,With all the riches in\Nhand, everybody rejoices!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.30,0:01:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Party on, cause we stand tall and proud!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.68,0:01:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Life is adventurous, be\Naware it's dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.04,0:01:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's gonna be one of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.20,0:01:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,And a trip goes on because.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.52,0:01:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We're the pirates of the mouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.26,0:01:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,To the west, to the east.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.96,0:02:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta find my way, sail away,\Nall the way to one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.78,0:02:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring all your dreams with\Nyou now, fill the void.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.26,0:02:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,In your heart, spread your wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.92,0:02:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And believe that you can soar.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.14,0:02:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Just let the breeze guide the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.04,0:02:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Till you're ready to start up once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.58,0:02:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're ready for more.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.40,0:02:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So many treasures await.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.60,0:02:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So now let's raise our voices in pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.14,0:02:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Laughing out when they are found.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.44,0:02:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,With all the riches in hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.30,0:02:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody rejoices, party on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.82,0:02:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause we stand tall and proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.40,0:02:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you're back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.44,0:02:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you were too hurt to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.84,0:02:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.80,0:02:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You look a lot better now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.26,0:02:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You really saved my life back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.78,0:02:40.61,Default,,0,0,0,,That was scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.69,0:02:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.61,0:02:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I was seriously injured when I dragged\Nmyself to the kitchen to acquire the salt,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.48,0:02:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,but then something most\Nfortuitous happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.52,0:02:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I discovered some delicious milk,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.76,0:02:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,which I promptly consumed,\Nthus recovering my health.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.38,0:02:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Calcium doesn't act that fast. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.42,0:02:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,So there you have it, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.22,0:03:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Milk can heal your broken bones! Lair!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.30,0:03:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, we have the salt we need now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.58,0:03:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,This should be enough to purify that\Ngiant, but it might be a close call.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.10,0:03:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And speaking of close calls, it\Nlooks like the kitchen's blocked off.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.08,0:03:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, we only\Nget one chance to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.86,0:03:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't have much time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.30,0:03:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's move it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.38,0:03:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,If we don't want to melt when the\Nsun rises, we have two objectives.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.72,0:03:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna feed the salt to that\Nmonster, and we gotta beat Moria.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.12,0:03:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You wanted a chance to get\Nyour shadows back from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.82,0:03:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, here I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.92,0:03:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and try.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.16,0:03:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'll warn you, I'm more than\Njust a passenger, nor a stomach.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.74,0:03:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,When I'm done with you, you'll\Nwish you'd melted away in the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.06,0:03:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll show you what real\Nnightmares are made of!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.38,0:03:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for this chance, Straw Hats.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.52,0:04:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear that I shall fight beside\Nyou with every ounce of my might.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.02,0:04:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Although this small\Ngesture scarcely repays
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.20,0:04:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,the debt I owe you for\Nrecovering my shadow,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.06,0:04:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall offer what assistance I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.94,0:04:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.86,0:04:10.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.77,0:04:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't need you breaking any more bones,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.84,0:04:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,so just hold on to the\Nsalt and take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.80,0:04:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I got a few tricks up my sleeves.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.68,0:04:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's try my anti-monster shells.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.86,0:04:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.58,0:04:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,If my last shot was too small, try this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.96,0:04:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Franky, are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.08,0:04:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna light this zombie\Nup with my special oil star.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.64,0:04:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.55,0:04:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Here I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.54,0:04:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Ignite!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.40,0:04:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Supersize...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.64,0:04:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Firebird star!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.60,0:04:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.02,0:04:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let a little fire get to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.70,0:04:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Those feelings of pain are\Nnothing but lingering memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.42,0:04:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,From back when you were\Nalive, it's all in your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.20,0:04:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Zombies don't have to worry\Nabout any of that nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.02,0:05:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Just calm down and put out the fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.20,0:05:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.60,0:05:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This is our chance, Zoro. Come on! Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.38,0:05:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, green sword style!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.08,0:05:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Great Buddha Duck!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.24,0:05:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,My turn, Jango Cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.02,0:05:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.16,0:05:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's coming straight at us!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.04,0:05:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Vente Floor should do the trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.86,0:06:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it! No fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.48,0:06:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,He's using our own attacks against us!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.86,0:06:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that, you guys okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.28,0:06:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold my new weapon, the Stern Beetle!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.76,0:06:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Hell yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.80,0:06:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm ready whenever you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.56,0:06:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a word of warning, I haven't\Nhad a chance to test this thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.14,0:06:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,so I don't know what will\Nhappen when I let it loose!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.56,0:06:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I can't handle this, bro?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.58,0:06:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm extra super this week.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.32,0:06:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I got it under control.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.94,0:06:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, then get in. Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.32,0:06:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Shoot me straight into that\Nthing's stomach, and we got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.84,0:06:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Special attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.12,0:06:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Iron Man's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.38,0:06:50.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.29,0:06:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Now this is some super speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.24,0:06:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Get ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.98,0:06:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,This border cannon of\Nmine was specially made
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.48,0:06:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,to take down sea kings and jerks like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.88,0:07:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to wipe that slug\Ngrin right off your face, Moria!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.48,0:07:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I keep forgetting he's so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.50,0:07:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,He might not look like him, but\Nhe's got Luffy's moves for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.12,0:07:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Franky, no! Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.08,0:07:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, don't die!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.16,0:07:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't stop now, Zoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.86,0:07:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a nice shot, but\NI'm afraid he's still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.38,0:07:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you stop on him?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.72,0:07:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.12,0:07:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.68,0:08:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit, he's gonna finish him off!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.30,0:08:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.21,0:08:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,He can't even move!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.32,0:08:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Thunderbolt!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.12,0:08:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, that cloud!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.34,0:08:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Tempo!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.46,0:08:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice shot, but where did it come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.80,0:08:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Lightning, it has to be her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.00,0:08:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the climb attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.54,0:08:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't know where she is, but Nami's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.24,0:08:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that flash? Was it lightning?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.82,0:08:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, frightening.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.24,0:08:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That must have been Orr's.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.54,0:08:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, he can do anything, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.04,0:08:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,There she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.44,0:08:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.64,0:08:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you stop yelling already?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.60,0:08:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Now they're going to know where I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.62,0:08:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,She yelled at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.12,0:08:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,She yelled at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.84,0:08:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like old times.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.60,0:08:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad you're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.38,0:08:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yell at me more, Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.94,0:08:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry I couldn't save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.02,0:08:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You can tell me I'll\Nscrew what I am all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.22,0:08:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you shut up?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.78,0:08:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the gun!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.34,0:08:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,See, I told you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.96,0:08:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Gun-gun!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.68,0:08:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.59,0:09:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, he's not going to stretch, is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.82,0:09:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, Danny?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.84,0:09:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It shouldn't reach her, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.20,0:09:05.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Usopp, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.14,0:09:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got to get Franky out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.88,0:09:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.30,0:09:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the gun!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.74,0:09:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.12,0:09:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He stretched! Impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.22,0:09:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It worked!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.78,0:09:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That was new, but it doesn't feel new.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.28,0:09:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got to be kidding me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.86,0:09:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.12,0:09:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.08,0:09:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,She's okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.00,0:09:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,She sure is screaming a lot,\Nbut at least Robin caught her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.94,0:09:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That was certainly a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.40,0:09:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not hurt, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.98,0:10:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,No, just shaking up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.24,0:10:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.04,0:10:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get it, but I\Nknow it can't be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.52,0:10:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Two people can't have the\Nsame Devil Fruit power.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.86,0:10:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if he has Luffy's shadow,\Nhe shouldn't be able to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.76,0:10:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Moria.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.00,0:10:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Must have been one of his tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.78,0:10:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna kill that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.08,0:10:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Now come, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.98,0:10:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, this is just great.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.46,0:10:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Now he's really like a\Ngiant monster, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.70,0:10:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.61,0:10:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You're destroying your own crew!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.86,0:10:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm kinda in a hurry here, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.76,0:10:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.94,0:10:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sorry to bug you like this, but\Nthis is really important, I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.88,0:10:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll only take a second of your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.56,0:10:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been looking all\Nover the place for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.44,0:10:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You're our only hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.56,0:10:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,They call the two of\Nus the Risky Brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.62,0:10:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The gang here is the Rolling Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.66,0:10:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And our captain is Lola, the Proposer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.42,0:10:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to get back to the mansion\Npronto so you can beat up Gecko Moria?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.58,0:10:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, pal?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.80,0:11:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right Now could you\Ntell me what you want with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.00,0:11:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, you're in luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.02,0:11:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Because we just happen to know\Nthe secret to taking out Moria!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.64,0:11:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We can give you the power to do it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.88,0:11:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And all you gotta do\Nis kick his ass for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.04,0:11:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you, a secret?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.22,0:11:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me power? Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.90,0:11:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously, who the hell are you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.66,0:11:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Allow us to introduce you to the captain\Nof the Rolling Pirates, Lola the Proposer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.62,0:11:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Current proposal count 4,443.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.44,0:11:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my, aren't you handsome.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.44,0:11:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you marry me? No, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.74,0:11:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Rejected!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.65,0:11:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That's 4,444!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.02,0:11:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Better luck next time!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.94,0:11:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.86,0:11:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Moria took all the\NRolling Pirate's shadows,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.10,0:11:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,so we're stuck wandering this\Nforest till someone gets him back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.34,0:11:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, he took my shadow, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.96,0:11:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I'm in a hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.10,0:11:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't take no for an\Nanswer, Straw Hat Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.08,0:11:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.26,0:11:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,In all of Thriller Bart's history,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.86,0:11:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,nobody has been able to\Nwreak as much havoc as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.92,0:12:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You walloped the Mysterious Three,\Nreturned some of the stolen shadows,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.54,0:12:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,and caused tons of property damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.34,0:12:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We've had nothing but\Nmisery in this crappy
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.56,0:12:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,place till you showed up\Nand started kicking ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.16,0:12:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,On the downside, it's kind of your fault\Nthat they brought Oars back to life.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.64,0:12:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That maybe wasn't so great.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.92,0:12:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We have a whole network of victims, so\Nwe know everything that's going on here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.38,0:12:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been stuck here without\Nour shadows for three years.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.06,0:12:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to spend the rest\Nof my life on this stupid ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.58,0:12:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,If you guys beat Merde up for\Nus, we could all get out of here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.08,0:12:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,and finally see the sun\Nagain after all this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.24,0:12:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,But we've got another problem right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.44,0:12:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Merde is making things\Neven tougher than usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.74,0:12:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You know where the bastard's at?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.90,0:12:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,He's camped out inside\NOrr's stomach. No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.40,0:12:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Did Orr's eat Moria? It's complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.12,0:12:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,He's in there piloting him like a ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.32,0:12:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, the point is, you're going to have\Nto take out that giant with your shadow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.56,0:12:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, you won't be able\Nto lay a finger on Moria.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.44,0:12:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,But I figure you would\Nwant to beat him anyway,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.66,0:12:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,since he's giving your crew a\Npounding out in the courtyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.92,0:12:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.34,0:12:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, I gotta help\Nthem before it's too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.82,0:12:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Not so fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.42,0:13:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Just sit tight for one second\Nand we'll show you our trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.12,0:13:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust me, you are gonna love this!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.40,0:13:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, boys, bring out the shadow!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.06,0:13:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.97,0:13:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.89,0:13:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Shadow's coming through!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.28,0:13:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.19,0:13:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You can grab them?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.11,0:13:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Once they're separated, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.36,0:13:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,When you feed the zombies a little\Nbit of salt and they come flying out,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.46,0:13:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,you can just nab them out of the air\Nwith your bare hands, no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.40,0:13:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hee-ho! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.88,0:13:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.84,0:13:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay still!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.74,0:13:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.65,0:13:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel like I'm gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.22,0:13:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, it's in. So, how is it? You\Ndidn't lose consciousness, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.26,0:13:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine all right i guess that's\Na start can you use a sword
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.54,0:13:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not as far as I know. Bring the sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.64,0:14:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, how did I do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.84,0:14:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's quite simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.94,0:14:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The shadow we just\Nstuffed inside you used to
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.10,0:14:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,belong to a powerful\Nswordsman from the Navy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.40,0:14:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like Moria did with my shadow.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.46,0:14:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but since you're still alive, it adds\Nthe shadow's fighting power to your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.44,0:14:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The point is, as long\Nas you don't pass out,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.28,0:14:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,we can stuff as many\Nshadows in you as we got.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.56,0:14:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since we figured out Moria's powers,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.46,0:14:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,we've been waiting for the\Nchance to turn them against him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.74,0:14:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,With a little boost,\Nyou'll be unstoppable.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.02,0:14:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We still have a whole\Nbunch of shadows left, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.72,0:14:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as you're tough\Nenough to withstand them,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.78,0:14:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,we can give you as many as you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.22,0:14:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,and your power will grow with each one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.66,0:14:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, but why do you have so\Nmany shadows in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.78,0:14:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The idea was to purify a bunch of\Nzombies and find our own shadows,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.34,0:14:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,not collect them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.25,0:14:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,But even if we didn't\Nknow who they belonged to,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.24,0:14:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,it didn't seem right to\Nleave them with the zombies.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.76,0:15:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So we thought, what the hell, might\Nas well take them back with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.28,0:15:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,There's one important thing you've\Ngot to remember about this, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.40,0:15:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,As you know, putting a shadow\Nin a corpse makes a zombie.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.46,0:15:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,But if your body still has a soul,\Nthe shadow won't stick around.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.40,0:15:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll only be powered\Nup for about ten minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.94,0:15:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,After that, all the shadows fly out\Nand go back to their original owners.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.12,0:15:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You got it, pal?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.36,0:15:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Just ten minutes, sink or swim.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.96,0:15:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll give you every shadow we nab,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.82,0:15:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,so you should be pretty\Npowerful when we're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.30,0:15:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a lot!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.22,0:15:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Shadows are not the fogs clearing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.94,0:15:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We only have about 20 minutes before the\Nsun rises and roasts all of us anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.66,0:15:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Our lives are in your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.52,0:15:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Steal your mind, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.20,0:15:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,When we tried this trick before,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.98,0:15:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,we could only handle two\Nor three shadows ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.06,0:15:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,But you should be able to\Ndo 20 or 30, no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.74,0:15:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Go for it, boys!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.06,0:15:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't agree to this!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.82,0:15:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,They're really slow down!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.46,0:15:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I had no idea this was possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.36,0:16:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen anyone with\Nso much willpower before.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.30,0:16:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I know he can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.94,0:16:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,He can beat Moria! Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.08,0:16:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all of him!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.06,0:16:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,He took all 100 shadows! Unbelievable!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.18,0:16:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, hey, buddy, you doing\Nokay with all those shadows?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.16,0:16:15.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Still feeling like yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.90,0:16:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You're still Straw Hat Luffy, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.72,0:16:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.38,0:16:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.54,0:16:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm getting stronger and stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.38,0:16:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I can feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.28,0:16:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He seems kind of different, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.20,0:16:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, it's not my imagination, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.82,0:16:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I'm pretty sure\Nhe used to be smaller.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.52,0:16:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.43,0:16:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel like I want to propose\Nto him all over again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.96,0:16:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,They all want to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.96,0:16:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The shadows want to fight now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.28,0:16:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let them go wild.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.42,0:16:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, there's not much time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.08,0:16:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Just ten minutes to show\NMoria the meaning of terror.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.88,0:16:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to escape from this hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.70,0:16:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Now get going, Nightmare Loopy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.34,0:17:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming for you, Moria!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.56,0:17:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.72,0:17:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The mansion's the other way!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.00,0:17:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Here it comes!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.46,0:17:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,This whole stretching\Nthing makes fighting fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.68,0:17:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.84,0:17:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.54,0:17:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,He just got exponentially more powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.10,0:17:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not like he ate a Devil Fruit,\Nso how's he able to stretch like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.66,0:17:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gotta be Mario.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.96,0:17:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What did he do?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.94,0:17:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,There you have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.18,0:17:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you know the nightmarish\Npower of the Shadow Shadow Fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.84,0:17:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Shadow Revolution.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.50,0:18:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Revolution?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.88,0:18:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,A shadow is a helpless prisoner\Nto the body that casts it,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.32,0:18:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,mimicking it like a reflection.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.38,0:18:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The body and shadow are physically\Nfused to the same shapes and movements.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.30,0:18:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a basic law of nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.26,0:18:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But I freed Oz's shadow\Nfrom the dominance of Oz's
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.16,0:18:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,body and taken control of\Nits form with my own shadow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.28,0:18:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I can now change the shape\Nof Oz's shadow as I wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.90,0:18:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,thereby forcing Oz's body to match\Nand follow its every contortion.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.24,0:18:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,As I said,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.44,0:18:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,it's long-natured that the body and\Nshadow must always hold the same shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.42,0:18:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,But now the shadow is no longer\Nthe subordinate, but the master.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.20,0:18:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The body is forced to obey\Nany shape the shadow takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.98,0:18:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the power of shadow revolution.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.84,0:18:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Moria is even stronger than we thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.22,0:18:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if Oz doesn't have a double\Nfruit power, he can still stretch.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.46,0:18:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,If Moria controls his shadow,\Nhe can rewrite the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.28,0:19:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a bit of cold comfort to know\Nthat Orz isn't actually a rubber man.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.60,0:19:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,If he has all the same powers,\Nit doesn't do us much good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.56,0:19:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Wasn't he tough enough already?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.28,0:19:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, give us a break here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.70,0:19:07.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.61,0:19:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It was hard before, but\Nnow it's almost impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.48,0:19:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, he has even more\Ntricks than Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.78,0:19:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,For example, if I force\Nhis shadow into a ball...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.66,0:19:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Orz will become a ball as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.80,0:19:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Spawn!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.26,0:19:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Dodge this. Roll!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.22,0:19:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Um... Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.20,0:19:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.82,0:19:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.44,0:19:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the big idea here, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.56,0:19:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.94,0:19:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I should get to try. Kashi!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.76,0:19:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.92,0:19:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't mean to interfere.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.74,0:19:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll just focus on assisting from here on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.52,0:20:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, crush each one of\Nthem however you see fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.38,0:20:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back here, Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.86,0:20:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be reckless!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.00,0:20:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, this just occurred\Nto me, but where is Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.18,0:20:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,He ran off after Moria\Nand got tricked somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.68,0:20:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure he's going to\Nbe back soon, though!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.72,0:20:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.63,0:20:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Does he have to do\Nsomething stupid every time?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.76,0:20:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.82,0:20:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.73,0:20:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,it probably won't help if\NI tell them another one
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.50,0:20:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,of the seven warlords is\Nsomewhere on the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.00,0:20:27.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get to that later.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.90,0:20:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I know I'm a little late to the\Nparty, but let me get this straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.20,0:20:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you saying we've got\Nto defeat Luffy, Zombie,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.28,0:20:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,and Moria if we want to get\Neveryone's shadows back?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.10,0:20:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that the gist of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.96,0:20:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's about it. You're kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.56,0:20:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The sun is almost up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.06,0:20:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The enemy is forcing our hand here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.78,0:20:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not like we have much of a choice!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.38,0:20:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.30,0:20:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,The skeleton?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.40,0:20:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't know you were here, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.46,0:20:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I beg of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.80,0:20:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, allow me to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.52,0:20:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I have an idea that just might work.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.90,0:21:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,My friends, I appreciate your trust in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.14,0:21:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think it should be\Ntoo tough to pull it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.58,0:21:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure about this, Brooke?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.20,0:21:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not trying to talk\Nyou out of it or anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.20,0:21:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,but you saw what happened to Franky,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.68,0:21:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.59,0:21:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't blame me if\Nanything goes wrong, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.34,0:21:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,But if this is what you\Nwant, I'm glad to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.74,0:21:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Dark Cloud Tempo!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.30,0:21:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm ready. Fire at will. I can't\Nbelieve we're using this thing again?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.54,0:21:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,There's one thing I fear more than\Ndeath—being unable to repay my debts.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.26,0:21:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll fight to the last bone you can\Ncount on me. Right. Try not to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.74,0:21:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm getting such a shock\Nthat I can see my bones!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.42,0:21:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I was only bones to begin with.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.82,0:21:58.41,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, here I come, like an\Narrow, forced with lightning!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.18,0:22:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Lightning bones!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.38,0:22:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, bone them all!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.00,0:22:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It worked!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.14,0:22:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,He shot straight through him!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.56,0:22:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a hole in me! Now's our chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.18,0:22:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow-up attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.18,0:22:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,As they say, mission accomplished.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.96,0:22:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice work there, Bones!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.48,0:22:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, two-sword style.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.38,0:22:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Tower climb!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.52,0:22:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.46,0:22:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You're next!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.56,0:22:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,But first, that skeleton's\Ngonna pay for hurting me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.00,0:22:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.50,0:22:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.41,0:22:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,He's going after Brock! Relax!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.10,0:22:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Brock, no! Skeleton!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.96,0:22:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.60,0:22:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Atlas Comet!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.14,0:23:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't work!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.38,0:23:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.64,0:23:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep fighting, Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.62,0:23:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.32,0:23:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You just made yourself next, long-nosed.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.96,0:23:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Your friend with the swords can wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.96,0:23:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a dead man!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.98,0:23:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Why can't I stretch?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.00,0:23:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Tochente fleur, Katorea manos.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.62,0:23:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd all these hands come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.68,0:23:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That's cheating!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.56,0:24:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it up, or I'll snap your neck!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.10,0:24:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Your shadow revolution is over!
